      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Public Root\n\n## Welcome → Learn More / Explore\n\nLearn More leads to a tutorial. Explore unfolds the public world: Twilite, Commons, Boulevard, and verified public destinations.\n\n**Each reveal answers the question raised by the preceding action.**\n\nStatus: proposed plan. Begin with the public-node inventory."
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "public-root-arrival-declaration",
          "nodeId": "public-root-arrival"
