    {
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Welcome, Learn More, Explore\n\nA plan for Twilite's public entry experience.\n\nFollow the four phases below. The public destination inventory and exact reveal gestures remain design decisions."
